abstract: >-
  Numerical code and saved data accompanying Quantum Oracle Value Readout:
  Coherence, Complementarity, and Fragility. Includes covariant discrimination
  and coherence-robustness SDPs, coherent photonic-analyzer simulations,
  mode-dependent loss examples, and validation of saved certificates.
